	0005-osk-widget-ABC-key-with-one-letter-per-line.patch
	0006-size-manager-A-virtual-output-doesn-t-cost-the-keyboard-its-height.patch
	0007-data-Start-along-with-Phosh.patch
	0008-input-surface-Dictation-also-without-an-active-input-method.patch
	0009-osk-The-microphone-key-shows-what-dictation-does.patch
